Datasets (obtain them from their authors; cite the original papers):
  - iBims-1 (Koch et al., TUM; https://www.asg.ed.tum.de/lmf/ibims1/). The project page
    states no licence; use is subject to the terms of the providers.
  - NYU Depth V2 (Silberman et al.; https://cs.nyu.edu/~fergus/datasets/nyu_depth_v2.html).
    The project page states no licence. The 654-image test split is read from the
    HDF5 files of the Hugging Face dataset sayakpaul/nyu_depth_v2 (card: Apache-2.0).
  - DIODE (Vasiljevic et al.; https://diode-dataset.org/), released under the MIT licence.
  results/ contains per-image metric values computed on these datasets, keyed by
  image file name; it contains no image, depth map or annotation.

Algorithms reimplemented from third-party code
  - score/boundary.py: the Depth Boundary Error follows compute_depth_boundary_error()
    of the official iBims-1 evaluation code (Koch et al. 2018,
    evaluate_ibims_error_metrics.py). The official file is not redistributed;
    tests/test_dbe_official.py checks bit-identical output against it when it is
    supplied.
  - gptq_eval.py: GPTQ follows Frantar et al. (2023).

